= Source and comparison

Every graphic above and the graphic below was generated by the unmodified
upstream `fiziko.mp` snapshot in `original/fiziko.mp`. The MetaPost calls and
geometry are in `original/main-original.mp`. Typst only lays out this page.

The source and Typst figures have the same order and nominal canvas sizes.
They are _corresponding examples_, not pixel-identical drawings: upstream
has different path interpolation, texture models, random choices and fixed
landmass data. Wood uses an explicit 1 mm grid setting for this large plate.
The sphere figures use upstream's default 0.2 pt minimum pen and shading
settings, so they are the direct source comparison for the density question.

